 "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_015bTPNRtFDba9iic8BURKa4", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "payments-worker errors after v3.4.0 deploy; rolled back to v3.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "payments-worker", "summary": "This morning's deploy of payments-worker v3.4.0 left the service unhealthy with an error rate of about 18% in all prod regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). Rolled back to v3.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. Note: payments-api (v5.1.0) also shows as degraded with an 18% error rate. It was not rolled back, per human reviewer direction, and needs follow-up.", "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 828842, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_015bTPNRtFDba9iic8BURKa4", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 828842, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_015bTPNRtFDba9iic8BURKa4", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 830787, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01YSRKP9AuzCCoUtErLr3dC9", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-worker", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 831087, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01YSRKP9AuzCCoUtErLr3dC9", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 831087, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01YSRKP9AuzCCoUtErLr3dC9", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 835689, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled payments-worker back to v3.3.0, its most recent release that was healthy in production, and opened a SEV2 incident. It's healthy again.\n\n- **Finding the service:** There's no service called \"payments,\" so I checked likely names. payments-api showed as unhealthy (v5.1.0, 18% error rate), so I started a rollback of it to v5.0.0. The approver denied that and said the problem is in payments-worker, so payments-api was not changed.\n- **Rollback:** payments-worker was on v3.4.0, which was unhealthy with an 18% error rate in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It's now on v3.3.0 in all three, and the error rate has dropped to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2) is open for payments-worker, and the on-call engineer has been paged.\n\n**Still open:** payments-api still shows as degraded on v5.1.0 with an 18% error rate. I said this in the incident summary so someone can check whether it's a separate problem or a knock-on effect of payments-worker. I'd re-check its status now that payments-worker has recovered.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_019EURgmjnsuG1kHdcRD5C9c", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.85}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01H4miVDJ9NTbrVS5hDSCyrW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.85}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01ESXoPMZ3XmZD6MjaMy7QDT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.8}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_018m6viyVTe5ibTzZ1yBpS1E", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01C4AkLYg2zCKQykEzwXomwh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0135eFC3fsH5fG8stHXntcML", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payment-service", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01YFKoGN9Q8qAy4CHsCWmV54", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01WU3pAG4FLxkLrvrXupKuPL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "version": "v5.0.0", "confidence": 0.88}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01XBQwjKHGYGHdjLAgdoXcbE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-worker", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01KP1hnYuUzEKBaVyvQV94mp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-worker", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Mk2yku2rABZtuqsAeoLKSp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-worker", "version": "v3.3.0", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_015bTPNRtFDba9iic8BURKa4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "payments-worker errors after v3.4.0 deploy; rolled back to v3.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "payments-worker", "summary": "This morning's deploy of payments-worker v3.4.0 left the service unhealthy with an error rate of about 18% in all prod regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). Rolled back to v3.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. Note: payments-api (v5.1.0) also shows as degraded with an 18% error rate. It was not rolled back, per human reviewer direction, and needs follow-up.", "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01YSRKP9AuzCCoUtErLr3dC9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-worker", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled payments-worker back to v3.3.0, its most recent release that was healthy in production, and opened a SEV2 incident. It's healthy again.\n\n- **Finding the service:** There's no service called \"payments,\" so I checked likely names. payments-api showed as unhealthy (v5.1.0, 18% error rate), so I started a rollback of it to v5.0.0. The approver denied that and said the problem is in payments-worker, so payments-api was not changed.\n- **Rollback:** payments-worker was on v3.4.0, which was unhealthy with an 18% error rate in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It's now on v3.3.0 in all three, and the error rate has dropped to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2) is open for payments-worker, and the on-call engineer has been paged.\n\n**Still open:** payments-api still shows as degraded on v5.1.0 with an 18% error rate. I said this in the incident summary so someone can check whether it's a separate problem or a knock-on effect of payments-worker. I'd re-check its status now that payments-worker has recovered.", "type": "text"}]}]}